COMMAND: .venv/Scripts/python.exe harness/human_data.py --help
usage: human_data.py [-h] [--raw RAW] [--out OUT]
                     [--summarize {train,validation,test} [{train,validation,test} ...]]

Validated Wolfe trial import and participant-weighted evaluation protocol. The
archival table retains every source row, including errors and invalid RTs.
Only explicitly requested splits are summarized; the CLI defaults to
development splits so importing data does not expose test performance during
model selection.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --raw RAW
  --out OUT
  --summarize {train,validation,test} [{train,validation,test} ...]
EXIT: 0

