COMMAND: .venv/Scripts/python.exe harness/repair.py --help
usage: repair.py [-h] [--out OUT] [--human HUMAN] [-n N]
                 [--iterations ITERATIONS]
                 {development,final,ablations}

Reproduce development fits, freeze selection, and run ACT-R validation.
Commands use the repository venv. Test summaries are first accessed by
report.py with --final-test after this driver freezes model selection.

positional arguments:
  {development,final,ablations}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --out OUT
  --human HUMAN
  -n N                  trials per cell per seed; defaults 30 development /
                        1000 final
  --iterations ITERATIONS
EXIT: 0

