  --source SOURCE
  --out OUT
EXIT: 0

COMMAND: .venv/Scripts/python.exe harness/archive_validation.py --help
usage: archive_validation.py [-h] [--root ROOT] [--out OUT]

Assemble reviewable summaries from explicit, completed repair artifacts. No
simulation or parameter selection occurs here. Missing required inputs fail.
Full trial data remain in the run directory; the destination contains
summaries, plots, configurations, hashes, and the command record.

options:
  -h, --help   show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT
  --out OUT
EXIT: 0

